  "description": "Flow King is an XrmToolBox plugin that gives Power Platform developers an instant, visual understanding of the Power Automate flows inside a solution.\n\n      Instead of opening each flow one by one in the Power Automate designer, Flow King loads them all at once and surfaces:\n      - Plain-English translation of every action\n      - Interactive flow diagram (Mermaid flowchart)\n      - Sequence diagram showing participant interactions\n      - Dependency map (callers, child flows, connectors)\n      - Entities and fields touched by each flow\n      - Automated health checks with severity ratings\n      - Cross-flow search by field name, entity, keyword, or expression\n\n      Requires Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime for diagram and search views.",
