  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0 — Initial release.\n      - Plain-English flow translation\n      - Mermaid flow diagram and sequence diagram\n      - Dependency map and Entities and Fields view\n      - Automated health checks\n      - Cross-flow search",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
